<section class="card data-model-card" style="margin-top:16px">
    <h2 class="h1">Logical data model</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Relational view for EduInsight.</p>
    <img src="@(Url.Content("~/assets/erd.png"))" alt="ERD showing Student, Program, and Term tables feeding the Enrollment fact table through one-to-many relationships">
    <p>
        The ERD illustrates our long-term design: <strong>Students</strong>, <strong>Programs</strong>, and 
        <strong>Terms</strong> each hold canonical details and connect to the <strong>Enrollments</strong> fact table 
        through one-to-many relationships. This layout supports richer reporting while keeping enrollments as the central record tying those entities together.
    </p>
</section>

